# tidy-objects: from the menu, load the saved game setup/tidy-heavy writes (the player carrying
# all they can, with 20 coins at their feet); look down twice, get mode (F3), the right button on
# the coins and Enter at "Move how many? 1": too heavy. The original loses the split stack's copy
# (the tooheavy session, DOS's golden); with the flag it is freed. Then a save to slot I
# described "tidy" and a restore of it: the object lists check out, so no "Problems in object
# list"
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
10000 key 1
11000 key 1
12500 key f3
13000 move 157 108
13500 mdown 157 108 right
13800 mup 157 108 right
15500 key enter        # Move how many? 1: too heavy
18000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "tidy"
18100 key s
18300 up ctrl
20000 key enter
21500 key t
21700 key i
21900 key d
22100 key y
23000 key enter
27000 down ctrl        # restore: Ctrl+R, slot I
27100 key r
27300 up ctrl
29000 key enter
